      <h2 id="main-framework-and-checklist">Main framework and checklist</h2>
      <p>To approach lead generation systems effectively, sales teams qualifying higher-intent leads should follow a structured framework. Here&#39;s a practical checklist to get you started:</p>
      <p>**1. Define your lead**: Clearly outline the target audience, their needs, and pain points. This will help you create more effective lead magnets and nurturing campaigns.</p>
      <p>**2. Create lead magnets**: Develop valuable resources that attract your target audience and encourage them to share their contact information.</p>
      <p>**3. Build lead scoring**: Implement a lead scoring system to prioritize leads based on their engagement and fit with your ideal customer profile.</p>
      <p>**4. Nurture leads**: Engage leads with targeted, personalized content until they&#39;re ready for your sales team to make contact.</p>
      <p>**5. Qualify leads**: Use a consistent, objective process to evaluate leads and determine if they&#39;re a good fit for your business.</p>
      <p>**6. Handoff to sales**: Once leads are qualified, smoothly hand them off to your sales team with clear, concise information about the lead&#39;s needs and preferences.</p>
    </section>
